{"title":"2023 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Smart_and_Simple)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Animated_Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Animated Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Magic Square</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Interstigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Interstigation</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_harungurcan\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by harungurcan</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-11\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(Solve_under_60_seconds!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">11</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (Solve under 60 seconds!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-12\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Dr._David\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">12</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Dr. David</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-13\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_WhyMath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">13</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by WhyMath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-14\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_SquishBJ_(AIME_Qualifier)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">14</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by SquishBJ (AIME Qualifier)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-15\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">15</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Nicolas is planning to send a package to his friend Anton, who is a stamp collector. To pay for the postage, Nicolas would like to cover the package with a large number of stamps. Suppose he has a collection of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-cent, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-cent, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-cent stamps, with exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> of each type. What is the greatest number of stamps Nicolas can use to make exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b69c271f2e4b51399ffb4ca45fc25192d89a9fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$7.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> in postage?\n(Note: The amount <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b69c271f2e4b51399ffb4ca45fc25192d89a9fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$7.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> corresponds to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cents. One dollar is worth <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" /> cents.)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/9/1e9795b214b0c8b5ee9bbd1e8bbd81badcbfe4f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 45 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 46 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 51 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 54\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 55$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"397\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's use the most stamps to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/2/f22ff993b3efaa92646c14f3dac7071e86924524.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.10.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> of each stamp, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-cent (nickels), <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-cent (dimes), and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-cent (quarters).\n</p><p>If we want the highest number of stamps, we must have the highest number of the smaller value stamps (like the coins above). We can use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> nickels and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> dimes to bring our total cost to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/e/1cee7387a234bcd1f400ca9b3902ef879164afe3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7.10 - 3.00 = 4.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"15\" />. However, when we try to use quarters, the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cents don’t fit evenly, so we have to give back <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cents to make the quarter amount <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/b/49bb9cef43f3d8117260049bbfc70787a4420d33.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />. The most efficient way to do this is to give back a  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />-cent (dime) stamp and a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />-cent (nickel) stamp to have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c5e2e4c4950cff11894abd202aa2949e21819c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$38$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> stamps used so far. Now, we just use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/b/99bfe1ff2a42053ff8c4608285c976f6be66ccb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{425}{25} = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"76\" height=\"38\" /> quarters to get a grand total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/d/d7d15f898a17ce8acb84dfa7428f0bab808dbd1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$38 + 17 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 55}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"147\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~apex304, SohumUttamchandani, wuwang2002, TaeKim, Cxrupptedpat, InterstellerApex, mahika99, RyanZ4552\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The value of his entire stamp collection is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> dollars. To make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/9/b69c271f2e4b51399ffb4ca45fc25192d89a9fb7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$7.10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" /> with stamps, he should remove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/c/bfcfee7bd8a5e15e5f6b7881c138de43651572a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cents worth of stamps with as few stamps as possible. To do this, he should start by removing as many <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cent stamps as possible as they have the greatest denomination. He can remove at most <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> of these stamps. He still has to remove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/a/77a9226a6b07b6cc0c473a26eba4320a61c987ca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$90-25\\cdot3=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"125\" height=\"15\" /> cents worth of stamps. This can be done with one <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> cent stamp. In total, he has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/f/1af0ba35b6c6908ad4d1b8f67fc549e5bb181ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\cdot3=60$\" width=\"82\" height=\"12\" /> stamps in his entire collection. As a result, the maximum number of stamps he can use is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a3ba2663a01846e9cd61fc212f16a448bbe0316.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\cdot3-5=\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 55}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~pianoboy\n</p><p>~MathFun1000 (Rewrote for clarity and formatting)\n</p><p>~vadava_lx (minor edits)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28A_Clever_Explanation_You.E2.80.99ll_Get_Instantly.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(A_Clever_Explanation_You’ll_Get_Instantly)\">Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (A Clever Explanation You’ll Get Instantly)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=1089\">https://youtu.be/zntZrtsnyxc?si=nM5eWOwNU6HRdleZ&amp;t=1089</a>\n~hsnacademy\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vq3voJZ-hvw\">https://youtu.be/vq3voJZ-hvw</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_.28Smart_and_Simple.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Math-X_(Smart_and_Simple)\">Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Math-X (Smart and Simple)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=GHLp1q_7Le68a4rJ&amp;t=2454\">https://youtu.be/Ku_c1YHnLt0?si=GHLp1q_7Le68a4rJ&amp;t=2454</a> ~Math-X note from InterstellerApex: this is wrong, he didn’t choose the correct answer&#160;:(\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Animated_Video_Solution\">Animated Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2023_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Animated Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/XP_tyhTqOBY\">https://youtu.be/XP_tyhTqOBY</a>\n</p><p>~Star League (<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://starleague.us\">https://starleague.us</a>)\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Magic_Square\">Video Solution by